<h2 style='color: #333333;'>Hi {{firstName}},</h2>
<p style='color: #555555; font-size: 16px;'>
  Thank you for signing up with
  <strong>FTNS</strong>! Please verify your email address by clicking the button
  below.
</p>
<div
  style='background-color: #f0f7ff; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; border: 1px solid #cce5ff;'
>
  <a
    href='{{verificationLink}}'
    style='display: inline-block; background-color: #28a745; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 30px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;'
  >Verify Email</a>
</div>
<p style='color: #555555; font-size: 16px;'>
  If the button doesn't work, you can also copy and paste the following link
  into your browser:
</p>
<p style='color: #007bff; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-all;'>
  {{verificationLink}}
</p>
<p style='color: #777777; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 30px;'>
  This link will expire after use. If you did not create an account, please
  ignore this email.
</p>